---
layout: base.njk
title: Topics
description: "WE's posts and idea pages sorted by subject (who owns it, work, rules, the machines, money, who decides) and by kind (Breaking, responses, five years, top tens, how it works, the 2030 serial, how to, obituaries, what WE learnt, ideas)."
permalink: /topics/
---
<p class="standfirst">The same pages, sorted two ways: by what they're about, and by what kind of thing they are.</p>

<p class="eyebrow">By subject</p>
<ul class="index">
{%- for t in topics %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ ('/topics/' + t.slug + '/') | url }}">{{ t.name }}</a>
    <span class="eyebrow">{{ collections[t.slug] | length }} pages</span>
  </li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>

<p class="eyebrow">By kind</p>
<ul class="index">
{%- for k in kinds %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ ('/kinds/' + k.slug + '/') | url }}">{{ k.name }}</a>
    <span class="eyebrow">{{ collections["kind_" + k.slug] | length }} pages · {{ k.blurb }}</span>
  </li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
